.idea
.vs
.vscode
.DS_Store
*.log
*.tmp
*.bak
CLAUDE.md
claude-docs/

# Auto-generated Helm values — audit/drift snapshots from extract-helm-values.sh.
# The committed values.yaml is the source of truth & the `helm upgrade -f` file;
# these dumps are local-only and regenerable. (helm-values-secret.yaml fragments,
# which carry real secrets/PII, are kept on disk and ignored via *-secret.yaml below.)
**/helm-values.yaml
**/helm-values-*.yaml

# Live-state captures used during reconciliation (kubectl/helm dumps)
ingress/traefik/_live/

# rclone configs carry obscured creds / crypt keys - NEVER COMMIT THESE
# (the k8s Secret is created from them via `kubectl create secret`)
**/rclone.conf

# Python bytecode
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc

# Secrets files - NEVER COMMIT THESE
# Note: secrets-template.yaml files ARE committed (they're templates with placeholders)
**/secrets.yaml
**/secrets-*.yaml
!**/secrets-template.yaml
**/*secrets*.yaml.bak
**/s3-backup-credentials-secret.yaml
**/*-secret.yaml
**/*-secrets.yaml

# Personal/local values files that may contain secrets
**/custom-values-personal.yaml
**/values-personal.yaml
**/local-values.yaml

